### 2. Using `filter` and `indexOf` (Preserves order)

This method iterates through the array and keeps an element only if its first occurrence (`indexOf`) matches its current index.

```javascript
/**
 * Removes duplicate elements from an array while preserving the original order.
 * @param {Array<any>} arr The input array.
 * @returns {Array<any>} A new array with duplicates removed.
 */
